{'symbol': 'VZ', 'date': '2022-05-31 13:31:00', 'title': 'VERIZON CUSTOMERS WIN BIG, USING MORE THAN 17 TB OF DATA AT THE INDIANAPOLIS 500', 'text': "NEW YORK, MAY 31, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- MARCUS ERICSSON MAY HAVE WON THE 106TH RUNNING OF THE INDIANAPOLIS 500, BUT VERIZON CUSTOMERS ALSO HAD A LOT TO CHEER ABOUT AT THE RACING CAPITAL OF THE WORLD. MORE THAN 325,000 PEOPLE GATHERED AT THE INDIANAPOLIS MOTOR SPEEDWAY (IMS) ON SUNDAY, AND VERIZON CUSTOMERS WERE WELL REPRESENTED AND WELL TAKEN CARE OF – USING MORE THAN 17 TERABYTES OF DATA ON RACE DAY. THAT'S MORE THAN THE 15 TERABYTES OF DATA FANS USED ON RACE DAY AT A SIMILAR RACE EVENT EARLIER THIS MONTH IN MIAMI."}{'symbol': 'VZ', 'date': '2022-05-31 08:55:00', 'title': '5/31/22: VERIZON DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'NEW YORK, MAY 31, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS AT VERIZON COMMUNICATIONS INC. (NYSE, NASDAQ: VZ) TODAY DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF 64 CENTS PER OUTSTANDING SHARE, CONSISTENT WITH THE PREVIOUS THREE QUARTERS. THE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON AUGUST 1, 2022, TO VERIZON SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON JULY 8, 2022.'}